{"version":1,"content":"<p>Meta悄然上線一款名為Style Sketch的AI時尚應用，幫助用户利用已有衣物搭配穿着方案。應用可連接Facebook或Instagram，從用户此前分享的照片中建立虛擬衣櫥；也支持拍攝單品照片、錄製短視頻，或從手機相冊導入圖片。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584442.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:32.682443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:27:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.280889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.280889+00:00","content_hash":"e8ec25e70a50d2baeea60336d59036281437666453f0c8a29f0d553463b16ad5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}